# Sampada — Environment Configuration
#
# The live stack is a Cloudflare Worker (worker/) + Cloudflare Pages SPA
# (frontend/). There is no Rails app, Postgres, Redis, or shared Better-Auth
# service. Values below are for LOCAL DEVELOPMENT only; production secrets are
# Worker secrets / SOPS, never committed.

# ── Worker local dev (worker/wrangler.toml provides bindings/vars) ───────
# Run: cd worker && npx wrangler dev       (listens on http://localhost:8787)
# Secrets for local dev (wrangler secret put, or .dev.vars — gitignored):
#   TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY   # Cloudflare Turnstile (magic-link request)
#   RESEND_API_KEY         # transactional email (magic links / notifications)
#   D1_PROBE_TOKEN         # shared secret for the /up probe (read-only verification)
# Never commit real values. See worker/wrangler.toml for D1/R2 bindings + crons.

# ── Frontend local dev (frontend/) ──────────────────────────────────────
# Same-origin proxy set in frontend/vite.config.js; no backend hostname baked in.
VITE_API_URL=/api/worker

# Production: Pages Function frontend/functions/[[path]].js proxies
# /api/worker/* to the Worker using the WORKER_URL Pages binding.
# WORKER_URL=https://sampada-api-production.<account>.workers.dev
